From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:13:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 142/155] [ae-patch] Show a usage limit item in the action dock
 at 90% of the account's window

When the account a chat runs on reaches 90% of its 5-hour or weekly
window, the action dock shows a limit item with Switch model, Switch
account (a full fork through the fork dialog's account row) and New chat.
Sending stays open; a dismissal lasts until that window resets. The gate
is a pure module, lib/aeLimitGate.ts, fed by the session's own
GET /v1/ae/limits?session_id= answer.
